            <Goto value="index_0_2"/>
          </Button>
        </Page>
      </Script>
      
       <Script label="index_0_2" type="dialog">
        <Page id="0">
          <Dialog npcID="109900" npcName="乐乐">亚特城居民身上有时会带有法杖，只是他们被洗脑了，对异族抱有敌视。你如果想拿到法杖，只有靠武力了！</Dialog>
          <Button label="明白！我这就去寻找法杖！" nextID="-1" close="true">
            <Goto value="index_0_3"/>
          </Button>
        </Page>
      </Script>
      
      <Click label="index_0_3" event="NULL" fire="true"/>
      
    </Click>
